Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?asteroids:=20connectivity=20privacy=20=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20NTP=20to=20Cloudflare,=20default=20DNS=20to=20Quad9?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

config_ntpServers: ntp://time.android.com -> ntp://time.cloudflare.com
config_default_dns_server: 8.8.8.8 (Google) -> 9.9.9.9 (Quad9)

Verified against lineage-23.2 frameworks/base config.xml (exact resource
names + defaults). These are safe RRO overrides of the same type/format as
the AOSP defaults.

Privacy: Android phones time.android.com for SNTP and uses Google 8.8.8.8 as
the default DNS probe. Cloudflare's 'time' service and Quad9 (9.9.9.9,
malware-filtering, no-log) are privacy-respecting alternatives.

Tradeoff: a network observer sees Cloudflare/Quad9 instead of Google — fine
for a privacy posture, but if you prefer to blend in with the Android crowd,
revert this commit (or pair with a VPN).

No impact on root (ReSukiSU) or lenOS hardening. Runtime-revertible is not
possible for NTP/DNS (build-time resources); revert = git revert <this>.
---
 .../FrameworksResTarget_Vendor/res/values/config.xml   | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/rro_overlays/FrameworksResTarget_Vendor/res/values/config.xml b/rro_overlays/FrameworksResTarget_Vendor/res/values/config.xml
index e0515f6..a8e246c 100644
--- a/rro_overlays/FrameworksResTarget_Vendor/res/values/config.xml
+++ b/rro_overlays/FrameworksResTarget_Vendor/res/values/config.xml
@@ -62,4 +62,14 @@
      <!-- Whether WM DisplayContent supports high performance transitions
          (lower-end devices may want to disable) -->
     <bool name="config_deviceSupportsHighPerfTransitions">false</bool>
+
+    <!-- lenOS connectivity privacy: stop phoning Google for time sync and the
+         default DNS probe. These are safe RRO overrides (same protocol/format as
+         AOSP defaults); revert by removing this block.
+         config_ntpServers: ntp://time.android.com -> ntp://time.cloudflare.com
+         config_default_dns_server: 8.8.8.8 (Google) -> 9.9.9.9 (Quad9, malware-filtering) -->
+    <string-array translatable="false" name="config_ntpServers">
+        <item>ntp://time.cloudflare.com</item>
+    </string-array>
+    <string name="config_default_dns_server" translatable="false">9.9.9.9</string>
 </resources>
